cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "SHCT — Slug–Hydrate Coupled-Transient solver"
abstract: >-
  A one-dimensional transient solver that carries the slug field and the hydrate
  field of a subsea multiphase pipeline in a single integration: holdup transport,
  conservative gas-mass continuity, an implicit pressure equation, energy transport
  and an advected hydrate phase field, closed by published correlations and a
  multicomponent Peng-Robinson flash, and advanced over a Monte-Carlo ensemble that
  returns a probabilistic time-to-plug. Includes the complete deepwater tie-back
  case study and every field, statistic and figure it generates.
type: software
